---
title: Sequence Diagram — Pay booking and send confirmation email
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant P as protect + authorize
    participant C as controllers/bookings
    participant B as Booking model
    participant RC as utils/receipt
    participant M as utils/mailer
    participant E as Email service (SMTP / Ethereal)

    U->>P: POST /api/v1/bookings/:id/pay {method, cardNumber}
    P->>C: payBooking(req, res)
    C->>C: parsePayment(): method card or promptpay, card = 16 digits
    alt invalid input
        C-->>U: 400 Bad Request
    else card ends with 0000 (mock decline)
        C-->>U: 402 Payment declined
    end
    C->>B: findOne({_id, user: req.user}).populate(hotel)
    alt not found or not the owner
        C-->>U: 404 Not found
    else already paid
        C-->>U: 409 Already paid
    end
    C->>C: amount = nights × hotel.pricePerNight (server side)
    C->>B: findOneAndUpdate({status: pending} → {status: paid, payment})
    Note over C,B: atomic update: a double submit cannot pay twice
    C->>RC: sendBookingConfirmation(booking, user)
    RC->>RC: QRCode.toBuffer("HOTELBOOKING|id|reference")
    RC->>RC: receiptHtml(booking, user)
    RC->>M: sendMail(to user.email, HTML receipt, QR inline, receipt attached)
    M->>E: SMTP send
    E-->>M: accepted (+ preview URL on Ethereal)
    M-->>C: {sent: true, previewUrl}
    C-->>U: 200 {booking (paid), email}
